// Class vocabulary: every vocation a creature can learn, declared as an
// ordered entry list. Each entry carries the birth data a classed
// creature merges into its rolled statistics: one statistic modifier
// per statistic (six, in vocabulary order) and the class's share of
// the hit die — the race adds its own. Load assigns each id a runtime
// handle in entry order; handles are unstable across loads (entry
// order decides them), so saved data must translate through the id
// mapping, never store raw handles.
[ ( class: "warrior", stat_modifiers: [5, -2, -2, 2, 2, -1], hit_die: 9 ) ]
